Everything else in this repository keeps its own licence: code is Apache 2.0 (LICENSE at
the repository root), plain.json in this folder is Apache 2.0, docs are CC BY 4.0.
Munkymind runs without catalogue.json: delete it, or set MM_VOICE=plain, and every
message falls back to its plain-language line. Forks that want their own personality
should write their own catalogue.
